Synchronize and inspect system crontab
integration

Usage:
  cron-person crontab [flags] [command]

Available Commands:
├─ show
│      Preview generated crontab block
│      without modifying crontab
├─ sync
│      Compile authorized directory jobs
│      and install into user crontab
╰─ uninstall
       Remove cron-person managed block
       from system crontab

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for crontab

Global Flags:
      --config string
        Path to custom configuration
        file (default:
        $XDG_CONFIG_HOME/cron-person/config.json)
      --store string
        Path to custom authorization
        state file (default:
        $XDG_STATE_HOME/cron-person/allowed.json)

Use "cron-person crontab [command]
--help" for more information about a
command.
